==Route 128==
[[File:Hoenn Route 128 RSE.png|thumb|Route 128]]

With all eight [[Hoenn League]] Gym Badges in hand, it's finally time to challenge the Pokémon League! [[Wallace]] directed you to an island in the east that holds the city of [[Ever Grande City|Ever Grande]]. To get there, leave [[Sootopolis City]] behind and use {{m|Surf}} to travel southeastward. Return to the ring of shallow water that marks the location of the [[Seafloor Cavern]], then turn eastward.
{{-}}
==Ever Grande City (South)==
[[File:Ever Grande City RS.png|thumb|Ever Grande City]]

Perched high above the ocean, [[Ever Grande City]] is lush with flowers. The island is divided by a large mountain that houses {{ho|Victory Road}}.

