====1F (Central)====
Wind your way under the first two bridges, then climb up the northwestern-most stairway. Turn eastward and cross over the next two bridges to reach a [[Max Elixir]] above the eastern ledge. Jump the ledge and battle Cooltrainer Albert near where the paths diverge. Take either path, then climb the first stairway north of the entrance. Cross the bridge and battle Cooltrainer Hope in the northwest area, then climb down the nearby ladder.

====B1F====
Deeper underground, the area is shrouded in darkness. There are two boulders a short distance to the south; use {{m|Strength}} to move the nearest boulder westward and the farther one eastward. Turn eastward, then take the northern path to the north-central area. Use {{m|Rock Smash}} to clear the cracked rocks first, then use {{m|Strength}} to move the first boulder southward and the second one northward. Follow the tunnel southward under the bridge to battle Cooltrainer Shannon. Climb the next stairway and cross over the eastern bridge to reach the ladder in the southeast corner.

====1F (Southeast)====
Pick up the [[PP Up]] to the west, then return to B1F.

====B1F====
Jump the ledge and head north past Cooltrainer Samuel. Move the nearest boulder one step north and one step west, then move the farther one a single step westward. Collect the [[Full Restore]] beyond, then return to the southeast ledge and climb down the ladder to the west.

====B2F====
Go north to fight Cooltrainer Julie under the nearby bridge, then use {{m|Surf}} to cross northward over the water. Climb up the stairway here, then take the northeast ladder up to B1F.

====B1F (Northeast)====
Pick up {{TM|29|Psychic}} to the south, then return to B2F.

====B2F====
Go south past Cooltrainer Owen and cross over the two bridges to the west. Battle Cooltrainer Caroline in the west-central area. Move northward to reach the top of the western waterfall, and surf eastward. Battle Cooltrainer Vito of the [[Winstrate family]] between the two waterfalls, and grab the [[Full Heal]] nearby. Sail down the western waterfall and head east to reach the next ladder.

====B1F====
Move south, then east to find more rocky debris. Use {{m|Rock Smash}} first, then {{m|Strength}} to move the first boulder southward. Use Rock Smash a second time to continue on and climb up the ladder.

====1F (Northeast)====
Climb up the stairway and cross over the final bridge. Move northward and battle Cooltrainer Edgar. Continue north and turn the corner and the exit comes into view, just as [[Wally]] catches up to you. The sickly child you met back in [[Petalburg City]] is no more. In his place stands a confident Trainer, ready to demonstrate how much training he has done!

