Wally admits defeat, but promises to continue his training and catch up to you one day. Continue northward and cross the bridge to reach the exit.

==Ever Grande City (North)==
With {{ho|Victory Road}} behind you, only a long, stone walkway separates you from the {{ho|Pokémon League}}, where the Elite Four and Champion await your challenge. Follow the walkway to the large building at its end, and prepare for your final test!



